<title>GERMANY: Douglas 1996 net income 105.6 million DM.</title>
<headline>Douglas 1996 net income 105.6 million DM.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>German cosmetics store chain Douglas Holding AG said on Wednesday 1996 net income rose two percent to 105.6 million marks on a sales increase of three percent to 4.3 billion marks.</p>
<p>Earnings-per-share, according to the DVFA accounting standard, rose to 2.95 marks, compared to 2.80 marks the year before.</p>
</text>
